sequenceDiagram
  participant B as 浏览器
  participant I as Ingest
  participant D as SQLite
  participant W as 聚合worker
  B->>I: 有限批次 events
  I->>D: 校验后 INSERT去重，COMMIT
  D-->>I: 已持久化
  I-->>B: ACK accepted / duplicate
  W->>D: 按ingest序号取有限批次
  W->>D: PV/有效阅读/UV去重 + daily upsert + checkpoint，同事务
  alt worker在commit前崩溃
    D-->>W: 整批回滚，下次从旧checkpoint重放
  else commit后崩溃
    D-->>W: 新checkpoint已保存，不重复累计
  end